OL,3,AMalaysian boy acquitted for murder of
OL,4,Aschoolgirl on grounds of insanity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Malaysian teenage boy charged with
OL,7,Fthe high-profile murder of a female
OL,8,Fschoolmate has been acquitted, with the
OL,9,Fjudge finding the boy was mentally
OL,10,Funsound during the incident.
OL,12,FHe had fatally stabbed Yap Shing Xuen
OL,13,Fin a toilet at their secondary school
OL,14,Fon the outskirts of the capital Kuala
OL,15,FLumpur.
OL,17,FThe killing of the 16-year-old girl had
OL,18,Fshocked Malaysia and sparked debate
OL,19,Fabout the effects of social media on
OL,20,Fchildren.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
