OL,3,AMalaysian boy acquitted for murder of
OL,4,Aschoolgirl on grounds of insanity
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice previously had said they
OL,7,Fsuspected social media could have
OL,8,Finfluenced the boy, who was 14 at the
OL,9,Ftime. The case was seen to have spurred
OL,10,Fauthorities to limit children's access
OL,11,Fto social media, which began earlier
OL,12,Fthis year.
